Dear RT Folks,

I'm pleased to announce the 3.14.77-rt82 stable release.


This release is just an update to the new stable 3.14.77 version
and no RT specific changes have been made.


You can get this release via the git tree at:

  git://git.kernel.org/pub/scm/linux/kernel/git/rt/linux-stable-rt.git

  branch: v3.14-rt
  Head SHA1: cb1bc206bfb1ec6b76b360850bfa079ba7b4f995


Or to build 3.14.77-rt82 directly, the following patches should be applied:

  http://www.kernel.org/pub/linux/kernel/v3.x/linux-3.14.tar.xz

  http://www.kernel.org/pub/linux/kernel/v3.x/patch-3.14.77.xz

  http://www.kernel.org/pub/linux/kernel/projects/rt/3.14/patch-3.14.77-rt82.patch.xz




Enjoy,

-- Steve

